- MDN Event Loop: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Event_loop
- Local: `mern-mastery/week-03/day-15/`

**Common mistakes**
- Thinking `setTimeout(0)` runs before Promises.
- Forgetting nested timeout in D's callback.

